    <briefdescription>
<para>This message is sent from WAL to TX when the WAL thread hits ENOSPC and has to delete some backup WAL files to continue. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The TX thread uses this message to shoot off WAL consumers that needed deleted WAL files. </para>    </detaileddescription>
